<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag, said it raised its indicative zinc price to 9,500 francs per tonne on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The last change was to 9,160 francs on June 27. In a statement the company linked the move to recent developments in zinc and dollar prices.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
